<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's GDP deflator down to 4.3 percent in 1996.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's GDP deflator down to 4.3 percent in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's gross domestic product deflator was 4.3 percent in 1996, down from 5.1 percent in 1995, a central bank report showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The consumer price index (CPI) rose by 3.7 percent in 1996, down from 6.3 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>It was the first time the deflator's rate was mentioned in the central bank's report.</p>
</text>
